  (text "Implemented: MCU, independent watchdog/brownout, SWD, manual reset, open-collector control outputs and default-off enables.\nNot implemented: packet processor, PoE/isolation, modem socket/SIM, high-current regulators or Ethernet. NOT a complete WAN appliance.\nJ101 is a 3.3V rail test header; J102 is an integration boundary, not a modem socket. No PCB layout exists." (at 27.94 45.72 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left)) (uuid "a1f92763-0a77-52d2-b561-422e137f9cb3"))
